plist.dict:
CFBundlePackageType
APPL
CFBundleName
Isoform
CFBundleDisplayName
Isoform
CFBundleExecutable
{{.OutputFilename}}
CFBundleIdentifier
com.wails.Isoform
CFBundleVersion
{{.Info.ProductVersion}}
CFBundleGetInfoString
{{.Info.Comments}}
CFBundleShortVersionString
{{.Info.ProductVersion}}
CFBundleIconFile
iconfile
LSMinimumSystemVersion
14.0
NSHighResolutionCapable
true
NSHumanReadableCopyright
{{.Info.Copyright}}
NSMicrophoneUsageDescription
Isoform uses the microphone for voice typing and, while listening is on, to hear what you say. Audio is transcribed on this computer.
NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription
Isoform captures the sound your computer plays, such as the other side of a call, and transcribes it on this computer while listening is on.
NSAppleEventsUsageDescription
Isoform sends you a text through Messages when it cannot reach your phone, and, while Mail is open, reads the headers of your recent mail (senders, recipients, subjects, dates and whether a message is read, flagged or answered, never the messages) to tell you who is waiting on a reply.
NSContactsUsageDescription
Isoform reads names, phone numbers and email addresses so you can choose which contacts to import from this computer.
NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription
Isoform reads your calendars to prepare you for meetings and plan your day. It adds a hold only when you say so. Events are kept on this computer; what a task needs is sent to the AI you chose and to your paired phone.
NSCalendarsUsageDescription
Isoform reads your calendars to prepare you for meetings and plan your day. It adds a hold only when you say so. Events are kept on this computer; what a task needs is sent to the AI you chose and to your paired phone.
NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription
Isoform reads your reminders, open and recently completed, so open ones count as your commitments and it can tell you when one is slipping. Reminders are kept on this computer; open ones can appear in your brief on your paired phone, and what a task needs is sent to the AI you chose.
NSRemindersUsageDescription
Isoform reads your reminders, open and recently completed, so open ones count as your commitments and it can tell you when one is slipping. Reminders are kept on this computer; open ones can appear in your brief on your paired phone, and what a task needs is sent to the AI you chose.
